OL,3,GNEWSAThe grieving family who say the
OL,4,Acoroners' courts aren't working
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer cousin, Daniel Lindsay, died in
OL,7,F2023, aged 41. He had lived at a home
OL,8,Fin Surrey that specialises in caring
OL,9,Ffor people with learning disabilities.
OL,10,FDaniel also had Down's syndrome and
OL,11,Ftype 1 diabetes.
